Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

This fork contains bug fixes only. No features were added, the mod was not
renamed or rebranded, and no copyright notices or attribution were removed.

The modifications are:

  * impl/providers/InteractionTrackerImpl.java
      Only record blocks that have a block entity, and add
      markConsumed()/clearConsumed() so a recorded block source cannot outlive
      the GUI it was used for.

  * impl/ChestTracker.java
      Pin the block source when a container screen opens, and clear it after
      the screen closes.

  * api/providers/defaults/DefaultProvider.java
      Pin the block source on screen open; use the corrected root position when
      a block is placed.

  * impl/DefaultChestTrackerPlugin.java
      Prefer the block source pinned at screen-open time, validate the GUI
      against the block using its slot count, and use the corrected root
      position with filtered other positions.

  * impl/util/ContainerSizes.java  (new file)
      Vanilla container slot counts and a plausibility check. Unknown (modded)
      blocks are always accepted so mod compatibility is preserved.

  * impl/memory/MemoryKeyImpl.java
      Purge stale connected links and sibling memories that reference a removed
      position.

  * impl/util/Misc.java
      New rootPosition(pos, connected) helper.

  * impl/compat/servers/hypixel/HypixelProvider.java
      Same root-position and pinned-source fixes for Hypixel Skyblock chests.

  * impl/compat/mods/ExpandedStorageIntegration.java
      Load Expanded Storage reflectively instead of through a compile-time
      dependency, because that mod is no longer published to any Maven
      repository.

  * build.gradle.kts
      Comment out the now-unresolvable expanded-storage dependency.

  * README.md
      Rewritten to document this fork, the original project and the changes.

  * .github/workflows/
      The upstream publish workflow was removed so this fork cannot publish to
      the original author's Maven repository.

